      "tags": ["image-processing", "module-interface", "qt-signals"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:include/Modules/Modules.hpp",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "Modules.hpp",
      "filePath": "include/Modules/Modules.hpp",
      "summary": "全局单例中枢头文件，定义 Modules 类以公开成员持有所有子模块实例，统一编排 build/start/stop 生命周期及模块间信号连接。",
      "tags": ["singleton", "orchestration", "lifecycle-management", "module-interface"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "采用 Meyers 单例模式（C++11 线程安全），checkFileExistAndFormat 模板函数自动验证并修复配置文件格式。"
    },
    {
